  "post_title": "Este domingo acaba la guerra de arroces (y fideuà) de Hosturionda",
  "post_date": "2015-07-24 08:00:03",
  "post_name": "comienza-la-guerra-de-arroces-de-hosturionda-que-este-ano-incluye-fideua",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Economía|Noticias|Sociedad",
  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">(16 fotos) Este fin de de semana, en concreto el domingo 26 de julio, finaliza la guerra de arroces y fideu&agrave; de Hosturionda,&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=57177\" target=\"_blank\">en la que participan trece locales</a>.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/07/GuerraFideuaHosturiondaHotelToledo-3.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">El restaurant Gran Hotel Toledo ofrece fideu&agrave; melosa de perdiz roja y sepia.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/07/P1110618.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Man&aacute; Bar ha preparado arroz de presa ib&eacute;rica, trigueros, napicol y aroma de tartufo.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/guerraarrossosfideuahosturionda15/guerrafideuahosturiondahoteltoledo-1.jpg\" alt=\"guerrafideuahosturiondahoteltoledo-1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/guerraarrossosfideuahosturionda15/guerrafideuahosturiondahoteltoledo-2.jpg\" alt=\"guerrafideuahosturiondahoteltoledo-2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/guerraarrossosfideuahosturionda15/guerrafideuahosturiondahoteltoledo-3.jpg\" alt=\"guerrafideuahosturiondahoteltoledo-3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/guerraarrossosfideuahosturionda15/guerrafideuahosturiondahoteltoledo-4.jpg\" alt=\"guerrafideuahosturiondahoteltoledo-4\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/guerraarrossosfideuahosturionda15/guerrafideuahosturiondahoteltoledo-5.jpg\" alt=\"guerrafideuahosturiondahoteltoledo-5\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/guerraarrossosfideuahosturionda15/guerrafideuahosturiondahoteltoledo-6.jpg\" alt=\"guerrafideuahosturiondahoteltoledo-6\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/guerraarrossosfideuahosturionda15/guerrafideuahosturiondahoteltoledo-7.jpg\" alt=\"guerrafideuahosturiondahoteltoledo-7\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/guerraarrossosfideuahosturionda15/guerrafideuahosturiondahoteltoledo-8.jpg\" alt=\"guerrafideuahosturiondahoteltoledo-8\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/guerraarrossosfideuahosturionda15/p1110613.jpg\" alt=\"p1110613\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/guerraarrossosfideuahosturionda15/p1110615.jpg\" alt=\"p1110615\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/guerraarrossosfideuahosturionda15/p1110618.jpg\" alt=\"p1110618\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/guerraarrossosfideuahosturionda15/p1110620.jpg\" alt=\"p1110620\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/guerraarrossosfideuahosturionda15/p1110621.jpg\" alt=\"p1110621\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/guerraarrossosfideuahosturionda15/p1110623.jpg\" alt=\"p1110623\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/guerraarrossosfideuahosturionda15/p1110627.jpg\" alt=\"p1110627\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://p